@startuml sequence-dtc
title Lost vehicle-speed signal → cruise cancel + DTC CC.LostCommunication
skinparam shadowing false
actor Driver
participant "Manual control" as MC
participant "Virtual vehicle" as VV
participant "Zenoh–SOME/IP\nbridge" as BR
participant "cruise_control\n(SignalLossGuard)" as CC
participant "cruise-control-diag\n(PR16 sovd_adapter)" as DIAG
participant VCU
actor Tester
Driver -> MC : I (fault injection)
MC -> VV : vehicle/control/speed_publish_inhibit = True
VV -[#red]x BR : vehicle/status/velocity_status stops
BR -[#red]x CC : SOME/IP speed events stop
note over CC : no accepted sample for\nbudget 1000 ms + debounce 100 ms
CC -> CC : disengage, stop throttle request
CC -> BR : adas_cc_cancel_req = true (event 30603)\nevery 50 ms until disengaged
BR -> VCU : adas/cruise_control/cancel_req = true
VCU -> VCU : cruise control off
CC -> DIAG : per-cycle observation: signal lost
DIAG -> DIAG : qualify DTC CC.LostCommunication
Tester -> DIAG : GET /sovd/v1/components/cruise_control/data/cc_lost_communication
DIAG --> Tester : status failed
Driver -> MC : I (restore)
VV -> BR : speed samples again
DIAG --> Tester : status passed (after debounce)
@enduml
